@startuml hardcoded_registry_pattern
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8

title Degenerate Pattern: Decayed / Hard-Coded Registry (deck.py vs soilconf.py)

package "Nightly Production Pipeline (ACTIVE PATH - DECAYED)" #FCE4D6 {
    class "run_forecast.py" as RunForecast <<CLI Entry>> {
        + --db: str
        + --station: str
        + --year: int
        + --parallel: flag
        -- NO soil config flag --
    }

    class "orchestrator.py" as Orchestrator <<Module>> {
        + build_spec(store: Store, stnid: str, year: int): ModelInputSpec
        + run_station_year(...)
        + run_all(...)
    }

    class "deck.py" as DeckModule <<Hard-Coded Registry>> {
        + SOIL: Dict[str, Tuple[float, float]]
        + LATITUDE: Dict[str, float]
        + DEFAULT_SOIL: Tuple[float, float]
        + DEFAULT_LAT: float
        --
        + soil_for(stnid: str): Tuple[float, float]
        + latitude_for(stnid: str): float
        + spec_from_readings(stnid, year, readings): ModelInputSpec
    }
}

package "Orphaned Modern Registry (UNWIRED / DEAD PATH)" #E8F4F8 {
    class SoilRegistry <<Registry>> {
        + stations: Mapping[str, SoilParams]
        + defaults: Optional[SoilParams]
        --
        + soil_for(stnid: str): SoilParams
        + {static} from_yaml(path: str): SoilRegistry
        + {static} from_ini(path: str): SoilRegistry
    }

    class SoilParams <<Value Object>> {
        + awc: float
        + rooting_depth_mm: float
        + latitude: Optional[float]
        + validate(stnid: str)
    }

    class "soilconf.py" as SoilConfModule <<Module>> {
        + spec_from_readings_with(registry, stnid, year, readings)
    }

    file "soil.sample.yaml" as SoilYaml <<Config File>>
}

' Active Production Calls
RunForecast ..> Orchestrator : executes batch
Orchestrator ..> DeckModule : calls spec_from_readings()
DeckModule ..> DeckModule : reads hard-coded SOIL dict

' Orphaned Path
SoilConfModule ..> SoilRegistry : defines & uses
SoilRegistry *--> SoilParams : contains
SoilRegistry ..> SoilYaml : parses YAML/INI

' Missing Connection
Orchestrator .[#red,thickness=2].x SoilConfModule : **NEVER CALLED IN PRODUCTION**\n(Orphaned Seam)

note bottom of DeckModule #FFCCCC
  **Degenerate Anti-Pattern:**
  Temporary 2008 stopgap (MRD-91) decayed into
  frozen hardcoded constants. Changing station soils
  or adding new stations requires Python code edits
  and redeployments.
end note

note bottom of SoilRegistry #D9E1F2
  **Remedy / Recommendation:**
  Remove hard-coded dicts in deck.py.
  Wire SoilRegistry into orchestrator.build_spec()
  and add --soil-config to run_forecast.py.
end note

@enduml
